{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/837909-transhuman-changeling","id":837909,"title":"Transhuman Changeling","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-02-26T20:59:05-08:00","id":837909,"title":"Transhuman Changeling","content":"I was reading the Cyclopean kith and looked at some of the wizened examples, while doing this I was struck with a stange ideal. Imagine a changeling specializing in dreamspun body modifications. Hands of solid flame or Mercury, eyes of with literal murder in them, clockwork hearts, hair spun of liquid gold. I'm really hoping the rules for dreamspinning are open enough for this. I think it would be a perfect booth in a goblin market. Does anyone else have ideals for dream modifications and the powers they might have.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11277-hyperspacewizard","name":"hyperspacewizard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11277_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-27T07:08:10-08:00","id":838037,"title":"","content":"I'd suggest going Dual Kith Cycolpean/Chirgeon so you can not only build them, you can surgically implant them too.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-27T07:20:56-08:00","id":838041,"title":"","content":"If you're looking for implant mechanics, check the latest Hurt Locker preview or the back of the Demon Storyteller's Guide. They both have guidelines for that sort of thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-27T09:21:17-08:00","id":838086,"title":"","content":"For something weirder and more disturbing, Contract of Animate Device with both the Wizened and Beast effects. Use that on say a pace maker or other implant or prostetic limb and make it a one dot retainer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-27T10:56:47-08:00","id":838135,"title":"","content":"Nobody's going to mention Token Limb from Dancers in the Dusk?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-27T11:37:03-08:00","id":838144,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/837909-transhuman-changeling?p=838135#post838135\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nobody's going to mention Token Limb from Dancers in the Dusk?</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't got it, but this sounds relevant to my interests.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10118-bronzedog","name":"BronzeDog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-27T11:40:56-08:00","id":838147,"title":"","content":"We don't know if it will be updated to 2e","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-27T11:46:13-08:00","id":838150,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BronzeDog</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/837909-transhuman-changeling?p=838144#post838144\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Don't got it, but this sounds relevant to my interests.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's more relevant conceptually than mechanically, but the short version is a Token Limb is a prosthesis used to replace body parts taken by a type of hobgoblin that steals and sells other limbs; it's got a Contract bound into it that informs its mien and can be used for a reduced Glamour cost at the price of messing with your Physical Skills and, if you use the catch, messing with your head until you get some sleep.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-27T11:57:06-08:00","id":838155,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/837909-transhuman-changeling?p=838150#post838150\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's more relevant conceptually than mechanically, but the short version is a Token Limb is a prosthesis used to replace body parts taken by a type of hobgoblin that steals and sells other limbs; it's got a Contract bound into it that informs its mien and can be used for a reduced Glamour cost at the price of messing with your Physical Skills and, if you use the catch, messing with your head until you get some sleep.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, an organ donation that might actually carry some of the previous owner's personality? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10118-bronzedog","name":"BronzeDog","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"239"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-27T12:59:31-08:00","id":838181,"title":"","content":"I could see an entitlement that focused around improving themselves becoming more and more mismatched replacing more and more of themselves with machines and dreamstuff kind of a parallel to the cheiron group in hunter. A blood transfusion of unicorn blood maybe could allow you to carry more glamour, an eye of a murder victim allows you to see into the twilight, the bargained for skill of a surgeon could be hammered into your brain, a captured lightning bolt could be fused with your nerves making you fast as a levinquick, Runes carved of silver and gold inlaid on your ribs that protect your heart and emotions, Dream ink tattoos that glisten and shimmer almost alive then when fed with glamour they are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11277,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11277-hyperspacewizard","user":"hyperspacewizard","date":". 02-27-2016, 05:10 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11277-hyperspacewizard","name":"hyperspacewizard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11277_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}